<title>NORWAY: SOCCER-BRANN BERGEN 1 LIVERPOOL 1 RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRANN BERGEN 1 LIVERPOOL 1 RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BERGEN, Norway 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brann Bergen of Norway and England's Liverpool drew 1-1 (halftime 0-1) in their European Cup Winners' Cup quarter-final first leg match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brann Bergen - Geir Hasund 47</p>
<p>Liverpool - Robbie Fowler 9</p>
<p>Attendance - 12,700</p>
<p>Brann Bergen: 24-Vidar Bahus, 26-Stefan Paldan, 16-Per-Ove Ludvigsen, 3-Claus Eftevaag; 18-Morten Pedersen 6-Eirik Skjalaaen, 5-Roger Helland, 27-Arne Vidar Moen (22-Mons Ivar Mjelde 45); 8-Geir Hasund, 9-Tore Andre Flo, 17-Agust Gylfason</p>
<p>Liverpool: 1-David James, 14-Neil Ruddock, 12-Steve Harkness 2-Dominic Matteo, 20-Stig Inge Bjornebye, 4-Jason McAteer, 16-Jamie Redknapp, 15-Patrick Berger, 10-John Barnes, 7-Steve McManaman, 9-Robbie Fowler.</p>
